+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+
+### Commands
+
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or refreshes a Sokrates landscape report, aggregating the results of multiple analyses found under an analysis root. It is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands.
+* `updateLandscape`: the same command as `analyzeLandscape`, with the same options. It is kept so existing scripts keep working.
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> -help` for the options of a command.
\ No newline at end of file
